Description: LuCI support for GL.iNet unsupported network protocols (wgclient, wgserver, ovpnclient, ovpnserver, tethering, qmi, wwan, relay, 3g, ncm, qcm, directip, callip, amneziawg). Displays interfaces cleanly in Network > Interfaces with real-time status and management options.
